northstar (1.0.23+ds-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release: security fixes that keep cross-origin frames
    apart from the embedding page, stop stylesheets reading form input
    and parse only HTML and XML responses as documents; tighter seccomp
    rules for sockets and signals; lazy parsing of stylesheet
    declarations; a working DNS-over-HTTPS setting; and rendering and
    canvas fixes.

 -- Andreas Røsdal <andreas.rosdal@gmail.com>  Thu, 12 Nov 2026 20:40:00 +0100

northstar (1.0.22+ds-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release: Google Safe Browsing with the local blocklist
    as fallback, UI translations in 39 languages with fallback through
    the system language list, translated built-in pages, and rendering
    and canvas fixes.

 -- Andreas Røsdal <andreas.rosdal@gmail.com>  Sun, 08 Nov 2026 19:45:00 +0100

northstar (1.0.21+ds-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release: --ignore-certificate-errors for self-signed
    home lab servers, Save Page As, postMessage origin and
    Function.caller security fixes, importScripts() under
    'strict-dynamic', and quickjs-ng 0.18.0 and Wuffs 0.4.0-alpha.12.

